Package: anovakun
Type: Package
Title: Analysis of Variance for Factorial Designs ('ANOVA-kun')
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ryuta", "Iseki", role = c("aut", "cph")),
    person("Koji", "Kosugi", email = "kosugitti@gmail.com", role = "cre",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5816-0099")))
Description: Performs analysis of variance for between-subjects,
    within-subjects and mixed factorial designs with up to 26 factors,
    together with multiple comparisons (Holm, Shaffer and related modified
    Bonferroni procedures), simple effects analyses, sphericity tests and
    epsilon corrections, effect sizes with confidence intervals, and
    confidence intervals of cell means. It
    distributes the 'ANOVA-kun' functions written by Ryuta Iseki
    <https://riseki.cloudfree.jp/?ANOVA%E5%90%9B>, where the methods and
    their references are documented, without changing their computations;
    the results are returned as objects that print the original tables.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/kosugitti/anovakun, https://kosugitti.github.io/anovakun/
BugReports: https://github.com/kosugitti/anovakun/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: graphics, grDevices, stats, utils
Suggests: lmerTest, lme4, pbkrtest, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
